  "description": [
    "A member of the class of benzimidazoles carrying a 1,3-thiazol-4-yl substituent at position 2. A mainly post-harvest fungicide used to control a wide range of diseases including <em>Aspergillus, Botrytis, Cladosporium</em> and <em>Fusarium</em>."
